  "caption": {
    "text": "Your MULTI/EXEC block does not roll back. A wrong-type command inside it fails, every other command still applies, and Redis will never undo them — that single fact breaks more Redis code than any race condition. This handbook walks the full ladder: pipelines for latency, MULTI/EXEC for grouping, WATCH for optimistic locking, and Lua for the read-modify-write you actually needed.",
